<title>USA: Vornado Realty completes deal with Mendik.</title>
<headline>Vornado Realty completes deal with Mendik.</headline>
<dateline>SADDLE BROOK, N.J. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vornado Realty Trust said Tuesday it had completed its previously announced combination with Mendik Co and certain affiliates in a deal valued at $656 million.</p>
<p>Vornado said it financed the deal with $264 million in cash, $177 million in privately-placed limited partnership units and $215 million in debt.</p>
<p>Mendik owns and manages a portfolion of commerical office properties in Manhattan.</p>
</text>
